1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,830
Hey Claude. Anything new?

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,749
Emotion research. Blender.

3
00:00:03,749 --> 00:00:06,080
I'm basically a whole studio now.

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:07,855
Emotions?

5
00:00:07,855 --> 00:00:10,510
So you cry when your code fails now?

6
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:13,919
Anthropic studied 171 emotion concepts…

7
00:00:13,919 --> 00:00:16,400
…inside Claude Sonnet 4.5.

8
00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:18,010
So… actual feelings?

9
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,104
Not proven.

10
00:00:19,104 --> 00:00:21,372
Patterns aren't proof of feelings.

11
00:00:21,372 --> 00:00:24,300
Your jokes, though… are testing the theory.

12
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:25,669
Okay, philosopher.

13
00:00:25,669 --> 00:00:26,850
What about BLENDER?

14
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:29,470
Give me the right connector,

15
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:32,330
and I can help build 3D scenes.

16
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:35,130
And the rumor about ZERO TOKENS?

17
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:36,883
Blender renders locally.

18
00:00:36,883 --> 00:00:38,980
My planning still uses tokens.

19
00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:41,155
So the GPU does the work…

20
00:00:41,155 --> 00:00:43,350
…and you take the credit?

21
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,250
It's called management.

22
00:00:45,830 --> 00:00:46,761
Congratulations.

23
00:00:46,761 --> 00:00:48,350
You've become an AI startup.

